{
  "Skill scaffold": {
    "scope": "markdown",
    "prefix": "skill",
    "description": "New SKILL.md with frontmatter and required sections",
    "body": [
      "---",
      "name: ${1:kebab-name}",
      "description: ${2:One sentence - what it does and when to use it}. Triggers - ${3:phrases people actually type}.",
      "---",
      "",
      "# ${4:Title}",
      "",
      "${5:The concrete failure this prevents.}",
      "",
      "## When to use",
      "- $6",
      "",
      "**When not to use:** $7",
      "",
      "## ${8:Procedure}",
      "",
      "1. $9",
      "",
      "## Anti-patterns",
      "",
      "| Pattern | Cost |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| $10 | $11 |",
      "",
      "## Exit checklist",
      "",
      "- [ ] $12"
    ]
  },
  "ADR": {
    "scope": "markdown",
    "prefix": "adr",
    "body": [
      "# ADR-${1:001}: ${2:decision}",
      "",
      "- **Status:** proposed",
      "- **Date:** ${CURRENT_YEAR}-${CURRENT_MONTH}-${CURRENT_DATE}",
      "- **Reversibility:** ${3|reversible,costly,one-way door|}",
      "",
      "## Context",
      "Forces: $4",
      "",
      "## Decision",
      "We will $5",
      "",
      "## Options considered",
      "| Option | Fit | Better at | Worse at |",
      "|---|---|---|---|",
      "| A (chosen) | | | |",
      "| B | | | |",
      "| C: do nothing | | | |",
      "",
      "## Consequences",
      "$6",
      "",
      "## The assumption most likely to be wrong",
      "$7"
    ]
  },
  "Exit checklist": {
    "scope": "markdown",
    "prefix": "exit",
    "body": ["## Exit checklist", "", "- [ ] $1", "- [ ] $2", "- [ ] $3"]
  },
  "Decision table": {
    "scope": "markdown",
    "prefix": "table",
    "body": ["| ${1:Situation} | ${2:Choose} | ${3:Because} |", "|---|---|---|", "| $4 | $5 | $6 |"]
  }
}
